Package: L3bin
Title: Integerized Sinusoidal Binning Scheme for Level 3 Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
   c(person("Michael D.","Sumner", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "mdsumner@gmail.com"), 
    person("NASA's OceanColor Web", role = c("ctb", "cph")))
Description: The NASA Ocean Biology processing Group L3 bin scheme, based on the sinusoidal map projection. Pseudo
 code for the binning scheme was published in  Appendix A of NASA Technical Memorandum 104566, Vol. 32., listed in URL. 
